  "reply": "To correct the misapplied insurance check, go to **Billing > Ledger History**, find the transaction, and click **Reverse Allocation**. After the reversal, reapply the funds to the correct service lines using the standard posting steps (Billing > Payment Processing → Unposted Remittances → Match Invoices → Post & Close)."
